   "body": "Scope addition from the LOT-049 cross-review (#348): besides the value shape and expiry, record the **domain and path** of W14's `Set-Cookie: quoteshardwarefr-prive-<post>`. The client stores the selection for `.hardware.fr`; a host-only cookie (`forum.hardware.fr`) would escape its unselect and re-quote the posted messages. Names and shape only, never a real value.",
